<!DOCTYPE html> <html> <head> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"> <style> body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f2f2f2; } p { margin-bottom: 20px; color: #333333; font-size: 18px; } a { color: #ff6600; text-decoration: none; } a:hover { text-decoration: underline; } .btn { background-color: #ff6600; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 5px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: all 0.3s ease; } .btn:hover { background-color: #4d4d4d; color: #ffffff; } .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; background-color: #ffffff; } h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 30px; color: #ff6600; text-align: center; } .small-text { font-size: 18px; color: #333333; margin-bottom: 0; } </style> </head> <body> <div class="container"> <h1>Welcome to COD King!</h1>
  <p>Hello <%= @name %>,</p>

  <p>
    Thank you for signing up for COD King. We are thrilled to have you as a part of our community of merchants who are using COD King every day to ease their cash on delivery verifications.
  </p>

  <p>
    At COD King, we are committed to providing you with the best possible service. We would love to know more about your business and how we can customize COD King to suit your business needs. Our team is always here to help and provide you with the best possible service.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    Go through our onboarding documentation to setup the app easily.
  </p>

  <p style="text-align: center;">
    <a href="https://codking.notion.site/" target="_blank" class="btn">Onboarding Documentation</a>
  </p>
  

  <p>
    Click the link below to chat with us instantly and let us know how we can help you:
  </p>

  <p style="text-align: center;">
    <a href="<%= @crisp_url %>" target="_blank" class="btn">Chat with us now!</a>
  </p>

  <p>Thank you for choosing COD King. We look forward to serving you!</p>

  <p class="small-text">Best regards,</p>
  <p class="small-text">The COD King Team</p>
</div>
</body> </html>